---
/**
 * Disclaimer (MDX): a short note set apart from the essay, small and muted,
 * in italics, after the closing line. It is not part of the argument, so it
 * should never compete with it.
 *
 *   <Disclaimer>One or two plain sentences.</Disclaimer>
 */
---

<p class="disclaimer"><em><slot /></em></p>

<style>
  .disclaimer {
    margin-block: 2.4em 0 !important;
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-line-strong);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    line-height: var(--leading-body);
    color: var(--color-text-3);
  }
</style>
